			"contractKind" : "contract",
			"documentation" : "@title WinSale\r\n@dev WinSale is a capped and refundable crowdsale.\r\nThe mintable token to be sold must have been previously deployed and passed to the constructor.\r\nAfter construction the owner of the token contract must transfer ownership to WinSale so it can\r\nmint tokens during the sale.  Ownership of the token will be transferred to the owner of the WinSale\r\nwhen the sale is finalized.\r\n\n * Tokens purchased during the sale are immediately minted and transferred to the purchaser.  The payments\r\nare held in a vault until the sale is finalized at which time the funds are either sent to the beneficiary\r\nwallet or refunds are enabled depending on whether the sale met its goal.\r\n\n * A WinSale may be closed at any time by the owner, who must specify whether or not to enable refunds\r\nwithout regard to whether or not the original goal was met.  To end the sale naturally, call finalize\r\nrather than close.\r",
